fund which is a defined contribution plan.\n** The Parent Bank has been recognising the liability of sick leave to full extent hitherto i.e. entire outstanding leave balance. In line with the Guidance Note on implementation of Employee Benefits (AS-15) - (revised 2005) in respect of Sick Leave, the liability in this regard is recognised based on probability of availing such leave by employees.\nThe Parent Bank's best estimate of contributions expected to be paid during the annual period beginning after the Balance sheet date, towards Pension is ₹ 1,857.57 (Previous Year ₹ 2,064.09) and towards Gratuity is ₹ 29.58 (Previous Year: ₹ 27.61).\nSurplus /Deficit in the Plan:\nParticulars | GratuityPlan\nFY202526 - | FY202425 - | FY202324 - | FY202223 - | FY202122 -","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1131","section":"Notes to Financial Statements","tag":"notes","page":335,"text":"FY202526 - | FY202425 - | FY202324 - | FY202223 - | FY202122 -\nDefi nedbenefitobligation | 267992 , . | 247511 , . | 228902 , . | 207055 , . | 189852 , .\nPlanassets | 267242 , . | 243049 , . | 222334 , . | 205547 , . | 188732 , .\nUnrecognisedTransitionalliability | 000 . | 000 . | 000 . | 000 . | 000 .\nबैैंक ऑҰफ़ इंडिया / BANK OF INDIA वािर््षक रिपोर््ट / Annual Report 2025-26\nParticulars Gratuity Plan\nFY2025-26 FY2024-25 FY2023-24 FY2022-23 FY2021-22\nSurplus/(deficit) (-)7.50 (-)44.62 (-)65.68 (-)15.09 (-)11.20\n321.93 41.01 124.29 240.77 152.27\nExperience Adjustment On Plan Liability (Gain)/Loss\n(-)0.63 40.27 11.51 (-)5.88 (-)42.37\nExperience Adjustment On Plan Asset (Loss)/Gain\nParticular Pension Plan\nFY2025-26 FY2024-25 FY2023-24 FY2022-23 FY2021-22\nDefined benefit obligation 22,624.96 21,915.55 20,471.32 19,180.02 18,379.20\nPlan assets 22,055.73 21,388.63 19,922.68 18,459.42 17,604.64\nUnrecognised Transitional liability 0.00 0.00 41.22 183.62 489.67\nSurplus/