 Regulation 17 (1C) and other applicable regulations of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, the appointment of Shri Pramod Kumar Dwibedi as Executive Director of the Bank under Section 9 (3) (a) of the Banking Companies (Acquisition and Transfer of Undertakings) Act, 1970 vide Notification Ref. eF.No. 4/4(iv)/2024- BO.I dated 24.11.2025 issued by Department of Financial Services, Ministry of Finance, Government of India with effect from the date of assumption of charge of the office till the date of his attaining the age of superannuation i.e 30.06.2028 or until further orders, whichever is earlier, be and is hereby approved”.\nनि�देे शक मण्डल केे आदेेश द्वाारा,\nBy order of Board of Directors,\nह/- दि�नांं�क: 21.05.2026 (रजनीीश कनााӇटक) स्थाान: मुंं�बई प्रबंंध नि�देे शक एवंं सीीईओ\nSd/- Date: 21.05.2026 (Rajneesh Karnatak) Place: Mumbai Managing Director & CEO\nबैैंक ऑҰफ़ इंडिया / BANK OF INDIA वािर््षक रिपोर््ट / Annual Report 2025-26\nNOTES:\nनोट््स :-\nThe Explanatory Statement setting out the material facts in respect of the business at item No.3 of the meeting is annexed hereto.\nबैैठक की मद संंख्याा 3 केे कारोोबार केे संंबंंंध मेंंं महत्वपूूर्णण तथ्̑ योंं� की जाानकाारी देेनेे वाली व्यााख्याात्मक वि�वरणीी इसकेे साथ� संंलग्न हैै।","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1206","section":"Auditor's Report","tag":"auditor","page":356,"text":"बैैठक की मद संंख्याा 3 केे कारोोबार केे संंबंंंध मेंंं महत्वपूूर्णण तथ्̑ योंं� की जाानकाारी देेनेे वाली व्यााख्याात्मक वि�वरणीी इसकेे साथ� संंलग्न हैै।\nMinistry of Corporate Affairs (“MCA”) vide various circulars issued from time to time since May 2020 including the current Circular No. 3/2025 dated 22nd September 2025 has permitted to hold Annual General Meeting through Video Conferencing (VC) or other audio visual means (OAVM) till further orders.\nकॉॉΖर्पोरेेटट मामलोंं � का मंंंत्रालय (\"एमसीीए\") नेे मई 2020 सेे समय -समय पर जाारी वि�भि�न्न परि�पत्रोंं� केे माध्̒ यम सेे जि�समेंंं परि�पत्र संं. 3/2025 दि�नांं�क 22 सि�तंं बर 2025 भी शामि�ल हैै, वीीडििƧयोो कॉॉΖन्फ्रेंंसिंΚ�ंग (वीीसी) याा अन्य ऑǛडििƧयोो वि�जुुअल साधƭन (ओएवीीएम) केे माध्̒ यम सेे अति�रि�क्त आदेेश जाारी होोनेे तक, वार्षििΜ�िक आम बैैठक आयोोजि�त करनेे की अनुुमति� दी हैै\nIn view of the same, the 30th AGM of the Bank is being held through VC / OAVM. Hence, Shareholders can attend and participate in the ensuing AGM through VC/OAVM only. The Head Office of the Bank shall be deemed to be the venue of the AGM. The Bank has appointed NSDL to provide Video Conferencing facility for the AGM and the attendant enablers for conducting the AGM through VC/ OAVM. The detailed instructions pertaining to remote e-voting, joining the AGM through VC / OAVM and Voting at the AGM are given separately hereunder.","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1207","section":"Auditor's Report","tag":"auditor","page":356,"text":"उसी कोो ध्याान मेंंं रखतेे हुए, बैंंक की 30वींं� एजीएम वीीसी/ओएवीीएम केे माध्̒ यम सेे आयोोजि�त की जाा रहीी हैै। अतः शेेयरधाƭारक केेवल वीीसी/ओएवीीएम केे माध्̒ यम सेे आगामी एजीएम मेंंं भाग लेे सकतेे हैंं। बैंंक केे प्रधाƭान कायााǴलय कोो एजीएम स्थल मानाा जााएगा। बैंंक नेे एजीएम केे लि�ए वीीडििƧयोो कॉॉΖन्फ्रेंंसिंΚ�ंग सुुवि�धाƭा प्रदान करनेे केे लि�ए एनएसडीीएल कोो नि�युुक्त किƚयाा हैै और वीीसी/ओएवीीएम केे माध्̒ यम सेे एजीएम आयोोजि�त करनेे केे लि�ए अटेंंडेंंटट एनबलर्सस हैंं। रि�मोोटट ई-वोोटिंΚ�ंग, वीीसी/ओएवीीएम केे माध्̒ यम सेे एजीएम मेंंं शामि�ल होोनेे और एजीएम मेंंं मतदान सेे संंबंंंधि�ƭत वि�स्तृृत नि�र्देेश यहांं� अलग सेे दि�ए गए हैंं।","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1208","section":"Auditor's Report","tag":"auditor","page":356,"text":"सदस्य नोोटि�स मेंंं उल्लि̟ िखिƛत प्रक्रि�याा का पाालन करतेे हुए बैैठक शुुरू होोनेे केे नि�र्धाधाƭाǴरि�त समय सेे 15 मि�नटट पहलेे और बाद मेंंं वीीसी/ओएवीीएम मोोड केे माध्̒ यम सेे एजीएम मेंंं शामि�ल होो सकतेे हैंं। वीीसी/ओएवीीएम केे माध्̒ यम सेे एजीएम मेंंं भागीदारी की सुुवि�धाƭा कम सेे कम 1000 सदस्योंं� कोो पहलेे आओ पहलेे पााओ केे आधाƭार पर उपलब्ध करााई जााएगी। इसमेंंं बड़ेे सदस्य (2% याा अधि�ƭक शेेयरधाƭारि�ताा रखनेे वालेे सदस्य), प्रवर्तक, संंस्थाागत नि�वेेशक, नि�देेशक, प्रमुुख प्रबंंंधकीय कार्मििΜ�िक, लेेखा परीीक्षाșा समि�ति� केे अध्̒ यक्षș, नाामांं�कन और पाारि�श्र�मि�क समि�ति� और हि�तधाƭारक संंबंंंध समि�ति� , लेेखा परीीक्षșक आदि� शामि�ल नहींं� होंं�गेे, जि�न्हेंं पहलेे आओ पहलेे पााओ केे आधाƭार पर बि�नाा किƚसी प्रति�बंंंध केे एजीएम मेंंं भाग लेेनेे की अनुुमति� हैै।","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1209","section":"Auditor's Report","tag":"auditor","page":356,"text":"The Members can join the AGM in the VC / OAVM mode 15 minutes before the scheduled time of the commencement of the Meeting by following the procedure mentioned in the notice. The facility of participation at the AGM through VC / OAVM will be made available to at least 1000 members on first come first served basis. This will not include large Members (Members holding 2% or more shareholding), Promoters, Institutional Investors, Directors, Key Managerial Personnel, the Chairperson of the Audit Committee, Nomination and Remuneration Committee and Stakeholders Relationship Committee, Auditors, etc., who are allowed to attend the AGM without restriction on account of first come first served basis.\nपरोक्षीʇी की नि�युु क्तिΊि:","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1210","section":"Auditor's Report","tag":"auditor","page":356,"text":"परोक्षीʇी की नि�युु क्तिΊि:\nलागूू प्रावधाƭानोंं� केे अनुुसार, वार्षििΜ�िक आम बैैठक मेंंं उपस्थि�ित होोनेे और मत देेनेे केे लि�ए हकदाार सदस्‍‍य स्‍वयंं केे बदलेे किƚसी परोोक्षीșी कोो बैैठक मेंंं उपस्थि‍ �‍�त होोनेे और मतदान करनेे केे लि�ए पाात्र हैै और परोोक्षीșी कोो बैंंक का सदस्‍‍य होोनाा आवश्‍ ‍यक नहींं� हैै। चूंं�किƚ यह एजीएम एमसीीए परि�पत्रोंं� केे अनुुसार वीीसी/ओएवीीएम केे माध्̒ यम सेे आयोोजि�त किƚयाा जाा रहीी हैै, शेेयरधाƭारकोंं� की भौति�क उपस्थि�िति� सेे छूूटट प्रदान की गई हैै। तदनुुसाार, एजीएम केे लि�ए शेेयरधाƭारकोंं� द्वााराा प्रॉॉǛक्सी नि�युुक्त करनेे की सुुवि�धाƭा उपलब्ध नहींं� होोगी और इसलि� ए इस सूूचनाा केे साथ� प्रॉॉǛक्सी फॉॉΖर्मम तथा�ा उपस्थि�िति� पर्चीी संंलग्न नहींं� की गई हैंं। हालांं�किƚ, कॉॉΖर्पोरेेटट नि�कााय वीीसी/ओएवीीएम केे माध्̒ यम सेे ईजीएम/एजीएम मेंंं भाग लेेनेे और ई-वोोटिंΚ�ंग केे माध्̒ यम सेे अपनेे वोोटट डालनेे केे लि�ए प्राधि�ƭकृृत प्रति�नि�धि�ƭयोंं� कोो नि�युुक्त करनेे केे हकदाार हैंं।\nAPPOINTMENT OF PROXY:","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1211","section":"Auditor's Report","tag":"auditor","page":356,"text":"APPOINTMENT OF PROXY:\nPursuant to the applicable provisions, a Member entitled to attend and vote at the AGM is entitled to appoint a proxy to attend and vote on his/her behalf and the proxy need not be a Member of the Bank. Since this AGM is being held pursuant to the MCA Circulars, through VC / OAVM, physical attendance of Shareholders has been dispensed with. Accordingly, the facility for appointment of proxies by the Shareholders will not be available for the AGM and hence the Proxy Form and Attendance Slip are not annexed to this Notice. However, the Body Corporates are entitled to appoint authorised representatives to attend the EGM/AGM through VC/OAVM and participate there at and cast their votes through e-voting\nप्रााधि�ɍकृृत प्रति�नि� धि�ɍ की नि�युु क्तिΊि:\nAPPOINTMENT OF AUTHORISED REPRESENTATIVE:","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1212","section":"Auditor's Report","tag":"auditor","page":356,"text":"APPOINTMENT OF AUTHORISED REPRESENTATIVE:\nसंंस्‍‍थाागत/कॉॉΖरपोोरेेटट शेेयरधाƭारकोंं� केे लि�ए (अर्था�ाǴत्् वैैयक्ति�िक /एचयूूएफ, एनआरआ ई आदि� केे अलावा) केे लि�ए यह आवश्‍ ‍यक होोगा किƚ वेे अपनेे बोोर्डड याा शासकीीय नि�कााय का संंकल्‍प/उसकेे द्वााराा प्राधि�ƭकृृत करनेे संंबंंंधी स्‍कैैन की गई प्रति� (पीडीएफ/जेेपीजी फॉॉΖर्मेेटट) प्रेेषि�त करेंं, जि�समेंंं उसकीी ओर सेे उसकेे प्रति�नि�धि�ƭ कोो वीीसी/ओएवीीएम केे माध्‍̒ ‍यम सेे वार्षििΜ�िक आम बैैठक मेंंं भाग लेेनेे और रि�मोोटट ई-वोोटिंΚ�ंग केे केे माध्̒ यम सेे वोोटट देेनेे केे लि�ए प्राधि�ƭकृृत किƚयाा गयाा होो। उक्‍‍त प्राधि�ƭकार देेनेे/संंकल्‍प कोो दि�नांं�क 08 जूून 2026 तक याा उसकेे पहलेे ई-मेेल द्वााराा headoffice.share@bankofindia.bank.in पर बैंंक केे कम्‍‍पनीी सचि�व कोो भेेजाा जााएगा और उसकीी एक प्रति� स्‍क्रूूटि�नााइजर कोो ई-मेेल\nInstitutional / Corporate Shareholders (i.e. other than individuals / HUF, NRI, etc.) are required to send a scanned copy (PDF/JPG Format) of its Board or governing body Resolution/Authorization etc., authorizing its representative to attend the AGM through VC / OAVM on its behalf and to vote through remote e-voting. The said Resolution/Authorization shall be sent to the Company Secretary of the Bank on or before 8th June 2026 by email to headoffice.share@ bankofindia.bank.in with a copy marked to the Scrutinizer by email\nबैैंक ऑҰफ़ इंडिया / BANK OF INDIA वािर््षक रिपोर््ट / Annual Report 2025-26","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1213","section":"Auditor's Report","tag":"auditor","page":357,"text":"बैैंक ऑҰफ़ इंडिया / BANK OF INDIA वािर््षक रिपोर््ट / Annual Report 2025-26\nto scrutinizer@snaco.net with a copy also marked to evoting@nsdl. co.in.\nद्वााराा scrutinizer@snaco.net पर तथा�ा एक प्रति� evoting@nsdl.co.in पर भी भेेजी जााएगी।\nThe attendance of the Shareholders attending the AGM through VC/ OAVM will be counted for the purpose of ascertaining the quorum under the Bank of India (Shares and Meetings) Regulations, 2007.\nवीीसी/ओएवीीएम केे माध्‍̒ ‍यम सेे एजीएम मेंंं भाग लेेनेे वालेे सदस्‍‍योंं� की उपस्थि�िति� कोो बैंंक (शेेयर एवंं बैैठकेंं) वि�नि�यमन , 2007 केे अंंतर्गगत कोोरम सुुनि�श्चि�˨त करनेे केे उद्देेश्य सेे गि�नाा जााएगा।","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1214","section":"Auditor's Report","tag":"auditor","page":357,"text":"वीीसी/ओएवीीएम केे माध्‍̒ ‍यम सेे एजीएम मेंंं भाग लेेनेे वालेे सदस्‍‍योंं� की उपस्थि�िति� कोो बैंंक (शेेयर एवंं बैैठकेंं) वि�नि�यमन , 2007 केे अंंतर्गगत कोोरम सुुनि�श्चि�˨त करनेे केे उद्देेश्य सेे गि�नाा जााएगा।\nIn compliance with the aforesaid MCA Circulars and Regulation 36 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, Notice of the AGM along with the Annual Report 2025-26 is being sent through electronic mode to those Shareholders whose email addresses are registered with the Bank / Depositories. A letter providing the web-link, including the exact path, where complete details of the Annual Report is available will be sent to those shareholders who have not registered their email address.Shareholders may note that the AGM Notice and Annual Report 2025-26 of the Bank will also be available on the Bank’s website www.bankofindia.bank.in, websites of the Stock Exchanges i.e., BSE Limited and National Stock Exchange of India Ltd., at www.bseindia.com and www.nseindia.com respectively.","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1215","section":"Auditor's Report","tag":"auditor","page":357,"text":"उपर्युुǴक्त एमसीीए परि�पत्रोंं� और सेेबी (एलओडीआर) वि�नि�यमन केे वि�नि�यमन 36 केे अनुुपाालन मेंंं, वार्षििΜ�िक रि�पोोर